This ontology fragment represents the classes `QOS`, `Post`, `Get`, `Delete`, `QOSResponse`, and `QOSRemovedResponse`. It also defines the object properties `postRequestBodyContent`, `getResponseContent`, and `deleteResponseContent`, and the datatype properties `TextYAML` and `ApplicationJSON`. The domain of the object properties is `Post`, `Get`, and `Delete` respectively, and the range is `TextYAML` and `ApplicationJSON`. Additionally, it specifies that `QOSResponse` and `QOSRemovedResponse` are subclasses of `PostResponse`, `rdf:Resource`, and `rdf:PlainLiteral`, and that they have `TextYAML` and `ApplicationJSON` as their ranges.
